      "id": 1000961,
      "name": "[Affinity] Like a Fish in Water",
      "desc": "Qingyi has evoked the Mindscape: <color=#FFAF2C>[Insulation Breakdown]</color>. After launching a Dash Attack or Dodge Counter, your character can <color=#2BAD00>immediately follow up with</color> certain attacks near the end of the Basic Attack combo.\n[Insulation Breakdown]：When Qingyi enters combat, <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Connect Voltage</color> is instantly restored to its maximum, and the accumulation rate is increased by 30%. When using her <color=#FFFFFF>Basic Attack: Enchanted Moonlit Blossoms</color>, if <color=#FFFFFF>Flash Connect Voltage</color> is at its maximum, the attack will reduce the DEF of the enemy it hits by 15%, and Qingyi's CRIT Rate against that enemy will increase by 20% for 15s.",
      "desc2": "Qingyi has achieved her daily water intake goal, and she is in her optimal state for the day.",
